  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ハーメンツヴァレー</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Harmentz Valley</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <JapaneseText>？？？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>???</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <JapaneseText>十八年前に墜落した空中都市の残骸だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The wreckage of an aerial city that crashed 18 years ago.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････なんですか？
わたし、あなたたちと
話しているヒマなんてないんです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>....What is it?
I don't have any time
to be talking to you two.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ない････ここにも････
どうしよう････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No....Here too....?
What should I do....?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ねぇ、君？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, you?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <JapaneseText>どうしよう････見つからない････
あれがないと、わたし････！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What should I do....?  I can't find it....
Without that, I....!</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ねぇってば！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <JapaneseText>はっ････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm....</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････！
君････泣いてるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>....!
Are....you crying?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････なんですか？
わたし、あなたたちと
話しているヒマなんてないんです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>....What is it?
I don't have any time
to be talking to you two.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ずいぶんとつれないセリフだねぇ
あんたの落とし物を
拾ってやったってのに</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You don't have to be so cold.
That thing you lost, 
well we picked it up.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <JapaneseText>えっ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>huh!?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <JapaneseText>これ、君のだよね
はい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is yours
right!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <JapaneseText>おいおい
礼のひとこともナシかよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, hey.
No word of gratitude?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <JapaneseText>泣いて探すほど
大切なものなんだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The way you're crying and looking.
It must be important, right?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あ････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh....</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････あ、ありがとう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>....Ah, thank you.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <JapaneseText>な～に、困っている人を助けるのは
英雄として、当然のことさ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A hero will always help a person
in need.  It's what they do!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <JapaneseText>英雄････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A hero....</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････やっぱり、ちがう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>....It's different, after all.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <JapaneseText>え、なに？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>W, What?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <JapaneseText>拾ってくれたことには
お礼を言います</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What you picked up.
Thank you.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <JapaneseText>でも････
もう、わたしに関わらないで
それじゃあ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But....
Don't get involved with me, anymore.
Alright?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あ、ちょっと待ってよ、ねぇ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, wait a bit.  Hey!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････感じ悪ぅ
おい&lt;Kyle&gt;、あんな女
追っかける価値なんかないぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>....I feel bad.
Hey, &lt;Kyle&gt;.  Don't you think
it's worth going after her?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <JapaneseText>いいや！　あの子に
オレが英雄だってことを、絶対に認めさせる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah!  I'm not a child.
I'll make her see that I'm a hero!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <JapaneseText>さ、オレたちも行こう！
ボヤボヤしてたら、あの子
どんどん先に行っちゃうよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's go too!
If we don't hurry
she'll get away!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <JapaneseText>いってらっしゃいませ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have a good day.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;0B:00000001&gt;{14}{34}{08}{C0}&lt;0B:00000000&gt;ガルドになりますが
お泊まりになりますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It'll be &lt;0B:00000001&gt;{14}{34}{08}{C0}&lt;0B:00000000&gt; gald a night.
Would you like to stay?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お泊まりになりますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Would you like to stay?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;03:00000000&gt;　はい　
　いいえ　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;03:00000000&gt; Yes 
 No </EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ごゆっくりお休みください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have a good night.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <JapaneseText>おはようございます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Good morning.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お金が足りません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not enough money.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <JapaneseText>またのおこしをお待ちしております</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>See you again soon.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{26}{06}{C0}を手に入れました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acquired {16}{26}{06}{C0}.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;item:FFFFFFFF&gt;を手に入れました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acquired &lt;item:FFFFFFFF&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{26}{0E}{C0}がありましたが
いっぱいで持てませんでした</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acquired {16}{26}{0E}{C0} but
inventory is full already.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <JapaneseText>何もありません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's nothing here.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
